error_signature: "alloc-dealloc-mismatch|operator delete\(void\*\).*operator new\[\]|delete _p;"
root_cause: "老 C++ 库（2003 年前后）用 new[] 分配数组却用标量 delete 释放（SMSDecoder 的 unsigned char* _p），在 clang/libc++ 下 ASAN 报 alloc-dealloc-mismatch；Release/NDEBUG 构建下此类错误表现为 SMS 解码测试运行期 SIGSEGV（139）。"
rec_approach: "源码将标量 delete 改为 delete[]（配对修复）；用 ASAN/valgrind 复现定位；修复后重跑受影响测试。"
match_keywords: ["alloc-dealloc-mismatch", "operator new[]", "operator delete", "SMSDecoder", "SIGSEGV", "delete[]", "libc++", "ASAN"]
error_excerpt: "ERROR: AddressSanitizer: alloc-dealloc-mismatch (operator new [] vs operator delete) on 0x... | SMSDecoder::~SMSDecoder() .../gsm_sms_codec.cc:474:3  delete _p;"
severity: P1
category: portability
last_updated: 2026-09-27
